# The machine-wide ~/.gitignore blanket-ignores every dotfile/dotdir (`.*`),
# which would otherwise silently hide files this repo intentionally tracks
# (e.g. .github/, Flutter's own .metadata/.gitignore). Un-ignore them here
# so `git status`/`git add -A` see them without needing `git add -f`.

!.gitignore
!.github
!.github/**

!cv_app/.gitignore
!cv_app/.metadata
!cv_app/android/.gitignore

!openspec/**/.openspec.yaml
